Step 1: Apne project folder me ek nayi file banao jiska naam exactly .gitignore rakho (VS Code me banao, usme upar wala code paste karke save kar do).

Step 2: CMD / Terminal me ye commands run karo:

bash
# Agar pehle galti se saari files add ho gayi thin toh unhe clear karo
git rm -r --cached .

# Ab gitignore ke saath wapas add karo
git add .

# Commit karo
git commit -m "chore: added .gitignore to exclude venv, node_modules, and env files"

# Push karo
git push -u origin main
Step 3: Jaakar apne GitHub repo ko refresh karo. Ab wahan sirf tumhare actual code aur folders dikhenge, na ki faltu ki venv ya node_modules ki hazaaron files.

